Y_BEAM_3_END_POS, Y_BEAM_4_END_POS
** The 4 "blue strand" x-beams (everything except the central i=2 one),
** needed in job 4 (FREE) to hold them in place while X_BEAM_2_END_NEG
** is released. Split neg/pos because the two ends carry opposite signs.
** Defined here (not in job 4) because restart preserves the FULL model
** database (sets included); defining them once, up front, means every
** later job can reference them without redeclaring the mesh.
*Nset, nset=NONCENTRAL_X_END_NEG
X_BEAM_0_END_NEG, X_BEAM_1_END_NEG, X_BEAM_3_END_NEG, X_BEAM_4_END_NEG
*Nset, nset=NONCENTRAL_X_END_POS
X_BEAM_0_END_POS, X_BEAM_1_END_POS, X_BEAM_3_END_POS, X_BEAM_4_END_POS
