** =========================== STEP A: ENGAGE =================================
*Step, name=ENGAGE
*Dynamic, Explicit
 , 0.1
** dt unchanged from the archived baseline (see header block above);
** this damping magnitude does not require a retune.
*Fixed Mass Scaling, dt=1.5e-06, type=below min
** Intra-step checkpoints every 0.02 s (5 across this 0.1 s step) so a
** crash mid-step can resume near where it died (oldjob=net_pullout_
** phaseA_engage, same job name, *Restart read with no step/inc given).
*Restart, write, number interval=5
